menu "ASIC frequency transition"

    config ASIC_FREQ_RAMP_STEP_MULT
        int "Frequency ramp step, in 6.25 MHz units"
        range 1 32
        default 1
        help
            Frequency changes are applied in steps so the chip and the core
            regulator follow the load change. A larger step makes start, stop
            and live frequency changes faster.

    config ASIC_FREQ_RAMP_STEP_DELAY_MS
        int "Delay between frequency ramp steps (ms)"
        range 10 1000
        default 100

endmenu
